    "html": "<p>A progressive transverse wave of wavelength <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"12.0\"></span> cm propagates along a stretched string. The table shows the horizontal positions of two points, X and Y, on the string at a particular instant.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Point</th><th>Horizontal position / cm</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>X</td><td>5.0</td></tr><tr><td>Y</td><td>8.0</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What is the phase difference between the oscillations of points X and Y?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{8}\"></span> rad</p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{4}\"></span> rad</p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{2}\"></span> rad</p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\pi\"></span> rad</p></li></ol>"
